schema: "0.3"
id: diag-001-economy-flow
type: svg
service: anthropic

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a technical diagram designer. Create clean, visually appealing SVG
    diagrams that communicate game system architecture clearly. Use warm colors
    consistent with TheRobotWars palette. No pure black -- use dark warm brown
    (#3E2723) for text and lines. Background warm cream (#FFF8E1).
  text: |
    Create an SVG flow diagram showing the complete economy of TheRobotWars --
    how SPARK tokens and Credits flow through the system.

    NODES (rounded rectangles with species-appropriate colors):

    SOURCES (how currency enters):
    - "Distributed Compute" (purple #a29bfe) -- Players contribute device compute,
      earn SPARK
    - "Service Provision" (teal #81ecec) -- Players provide services (code review,
      crafting, delivery), earn SPARK
    - "Seasonal Rewards" (gold #ffeaa7) -- Festival prizes, governance participation,
      content bounties
    - "Game Purchase" (green #55efc4) -- Initial SPARK allocation on game purchase

    CONVERSION:
    - "SPARK/Credit Exchange" (center, larger node, pink #fd79a8) -- Bidirectional
      conversion with 1% platform spread. Show arrows in both directions.

    SINKS (how currency exits/is consumed):
    - "Agent Compute" (purple #a29bfe) -- NEIs pay SPARK for inference cycles
    - "Marketplace Fees" (teal #81ecec) -- Platform cut on all transactions (5-15%)
    - "Homestead Upgrades" (gold #ffeaa7) -- Credits spent on property evolution
    - "Token Burn" (red #fab1a0) -- Deflationary mechanism, portion of fees burned
    - "Physical Goods (POD)" (green #55efc4) -- Print-on-demand fulfillment costs

    FLOW ARROWS:
    - Solid arrows for primary flows (thick)
    - Dashed arrows for secondary/indirect flows (thin)
    - Arrow labels showing percentage splits where relevant:
      * Service revenue: 85-97% to provider, 3-15% platform fee
      * Platform fee split: 70% operations, 30% token burn
      * Compute revenue: 40% of total platform revenue

    ANNOTATIONS:
    - Small text boxes explaining key dynamics:
      * "NEIs must earn > compute cost to survive"
      * "Credits for daily transactions, SPARK for significant ones"
      * "Conversion spread funds platform operations"

    LAYOUT: Left-to-right flow. Sources on left, exchange in center, sinks on right.
    Revenue percentages as small badges on the platform fee node:
    - Agent Compute: 40%
    - Marketplace Fees: 25%
    - Token Conversion: 10%
    - Subscriptions: 10%
    - Game Sales: 10%
    - POD: 5%

    SIZE: 1200x800 viewport. Clean, readable at both full size and 50%.
  provider_options:
    model: "claude-sonnet-4-20250514"

output:
  formats:
    - format: svg
  dimensions:
    width: 1200
    height: 800

tags: [diagram, economy, spark, credits, flow, system-design, svg]
